    "description": "Sun-Life Holding Co.,Ltd. provides wedding ceremony, funeral, and nursing care services in Japan. The company operates through Hotel segment, Ceremony business, and Nursing Care segment. The company operates hotels and ceremonial halls, as well as nursing homes and senior residences. It is also involved in the assistance with pet funerals; commemorative photo shoots for children; cleaning services; and embalming services, as well as sale of urns. Further, It manage cemetery and estate, as well as provide real estate brokerage services. The company was formerly known as Sun Life Corporation and changed its name to Sun-Life Holding Co.,Ltd. in October 2018. Sun-Life Holding Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1933 and is headquartered in Hiratsuka, Japan."
